/main/CHANGELOG.md\",\n    68→    \"date\": \"2026-03-19\",\n    69→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    70→  },\n    71→  {\n    72→    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    73→    \"title\": \"Persistent Agent Thread Feature (Mobile/Desktop Control)\",\n    74→    \"description\": \"Pro and Max plan users can access a persistent agent thread via Claude Desktop or Claude for iOS/Android to manage tasks in Cowork, extending Claude Code's agentic capabilities to mobile devices.\",\n    75→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    76→    \"url\": \"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/12138966-release-notes\",\n    77→    \"date\": \"2026-03-17\",\n    78→    \"community_feedback\": [\n    79→      {\n    80→        \"quote\": \"Reports of code's death are greatly exaggerated - Chris Lattner reviewed a compiler written entirely by Claude AI\",\n    81→        \"source\": \"HackerNews\",\n    82→        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n    83→      }\n    84→    ]\n    85→  },\n    86→  {\n    87→    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    88→    \"title\": \"Voice Mode, Session Forking, and Remote Control\",\n    89→    \"description\": \"Major March 2026 updates bringing Voice Mode with 20-language support and push-to-talk functionality, session forking for isolated sub-agent execution, remote sessions with session teleportation between devices, enhanced transcript search, improved sandbox controls, and customizable keybindings.\",\n    90→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    91→    \"url\": \"https://buungroup.com/blog/claude-code-new-features-2026\",\n    92→    \"date\": \"2026-03-15\",\n    93→    \"community_feedback\": [\n    94→      {\n    95→        \"quote\": \"Claude Code and the Great Productivity Panic of 2026 - spending time working with Claude Code leaves me feeling the same way I feel after a day scrolling Reddit and HN - a thin, jittery, frayed...\",\n    96→        \"source\": \"HackerNews\",\n    97→        \"sentiment\": \"neutral\"\n    98→      },\n  